{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17637","headline":"酬卢司门晚夏过永宁里弊居林亭见寄 · 羊士谔","name":"酬卢司门晚夏过永宁里弊居林亭见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自叹淮阳卧，谁知去国心。\n幽亭来北户，高韵得南金。\n苔甃窥泉少，篮舆爱竹深。\n风蝉一清暑，应喜脱朝簪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17637.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17637","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}